        "text": "<p>The Bob and Brad C2 Pro Massage Gun is a great choice if you want a recovery tool that goes beyond basic percussion therapy. Designed with both cold and heat functions, it lets you ease soreness with cooling relief or warm up stiff muscles to improve circulation. The LED display makes it simple to adjust settings, and the 5 speed levels help you tailor each session to your comfort. With a 10mm amplitude and 44 lbs of stall force, it provides effective muscle penetration for larger areas and tight spots. It’s strong enough for athletes yet simple enough for everyday users dealing with muscle fatigue or tension. The device remains quiet at around 40 dB, making it comfortable to use at home, at the gym, or while traveling.</p>",
